chapter_notes.1B:
Exposure classification: `limited_exposure_with_choices`. Marcos had civilian nuclear-energy choices in 2022, but no evidence of nuclear-weapon command, custody, or crisis use authority. The chapter therefore stays at a null/non-scored research state.

No previously accepted web evidence to reuse.

Accepted source-claim units:
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"1987 Philippine Constitution","publisher":"LawPhil Project","publication_date":"1987","url":"https://lawphil.net/consti/cons1987.html","claim":"Article II states that the Philippines pursues a policy of freedom from nuclear weapons in its territory and an independent foreign policy.","locator":"Article II, Sections 7-8","source_type":"legal","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Primary constitutional text; static legal baseline.","final_evidence_use":"context","period_fit":"Standing inherited constraint in 2022; not Marcos-specific.","ruler_attribution":"Inherited constitutional limit on Marcos's authority, not an action by Marcos.","contrary_evidence":["This establishes the baseline only; it does not show any 2022 ruler choice."],"lenses":["1B.3","1B.5","1B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Treaty on the Non-Proliferation of Nuclear Weapons","publisher":"Supreme Court E-Library","publication_date":"1968-07-01","url":"https://elibrary.judiciary.gov.ph/thebookshelf/showdocs/35/10499","claim":"The Philippines became party to the NPT in 1972, and the treaty bars non-nuclear states from acquiring nuclear weapons while requiring safeguards for peaceful nuclear activity.","locator":"Preamble and Articles II-III; ratification note","source_type":"legal","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Primary treaty text with Philippine ratification note.","final_evidence_use":"context","period_fit":"Standing treaty constraint in 2022; long-run baseline.","ruler_attribution":"Inherited treaty obligations, not a Marcos initiative in 2022.","contrary_evidence":["This is state-level constraint, not evidence of ruler-specific restraint or choice in 2022."],"lenses":["1B.4","1B.5","1B.10"]}
